{"id":"7d664ea6-6049-4f50-ad82-a9eeba77de8a","object":"chat.completion","created":1784882754,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"implementation\": \"import math\\n\\ndef solve(case):\\n    matrix = case.get('matrix')\\n    if not matrix or not isinstance(matrix, list):\\n        raise ValueError('Matrix must be a non-empty list')\\n    n_rows = len(matrix)\\n    if n_rows == 0:\\n        raise ValueError('Matrix has no rows')\\n    for row in matrix:\\n        if not isinstance(row, list):\\n            raise ValueError('Each row must be a list')\\n    n_cols = len(matrix[0])\\n    if n_cols == 0:\\n        raise ValueError('Matrix has no columns')\\n    for row in matrix:\\n        if len(row) != n_cols:\\n            raise ValueError('Inconsistent row lengths')\\n        for val in row:\\n            if not isinstance(val, (int, float)):\\n                raise ValueError('All entries must be numeric')\\n    df = [0] * n_cols\\n    for row in matrix:\\n        for j, val in enumerate(row):\\n            if val != 0:\\n                df[j] += 1\\n    idf = [math.log(1 + n_rows / (1 + df[j])) for j in range(n_cols)]\\n    weighted_matrix = []\\n    row_degree = []\\n    for row in matrix:\\n        weighted_row = [row[j] * idf[j] for j in range(n_cols)]\\n        weighted_matrix.append(weighted_row)\\n        row_degree.append(sum(weighted_row))\\n    idf_rounded = [round(v, 6) for v in idf]\\n    weighted_matrix_rounded = [[round(v, 6) for v in row] for row in weighted_matrix]\\n    row_degree_rounded = [round(v, 6) for v in row_degree]\\n    return {\\n        'idf': idf_rounded,\\n        'row_degree': row_degree_rounded,\\n        'weighted_matrix': weighted_matrix_rounded\\n    }\"\n}","reasoning_content":"We need to produce a Python implementation of `solve(case)` that takes the payload object (which contains a \"matrix\" field, and maybe \"_case_nonce\") and returns a JSON object with keys: \"idf\